### ============================================================
### 10.12) GET — Verify bằng cách xem lesson detail (có kèm quiz)
### ============================================================

### 10.12.1) GET — Lesson detail (student view, cần đã enroll)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 10.12.2) GET — Section detail (xem quiz được nhúng vào section TEST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{testSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}


### ============================================================
### 10.13) (OPTIONAL) DỌN DẸP
### ============================================================

### 10.13.1) DELETE — Xoá mền section TEST (cũng xoá luôn quiz bên trong)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{testSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 10.13.2) DELETE — Xoá section KANJI tạo ra để test lỗi
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{kanjiSecForFailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 10.13.3) DELETE — Xoá mền lesson
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}